=== item 1: GT handling of the toolkit
   toolkit/utils/statistics.py success_overlap: mask = (gt w > 0) & (gt h > 0), IoU = -1 where the mask is false (NaN > 0 is false), and the
   success at every threshold divides by n_frame = ALL frames of the sequence (toolkit/evaluation/ope_benchmark.py; NATVideo has no "absent"
   attribute, so no frame is dropped). Frames with an absent GT are therefore SCORED, as failures, in every tracker.

